# What the production image is built without (owner, 26 Sep 2026: "Scripts in
# the production container: no exemption. Remove reach-*.mjs from the image.").
#
# A script left in /app can be run with `railway ssh … node x.mjs` against the
# live key, and on 26 Sep one was: a bench spent a display search on nobody's
# behalf. The scripts and the data they were fitted on stay in git as the
# record; they are simply not shipped. The paid door refuses them anyway
# (apps/api/src/sources/paidGate.js) — this is the second lock, not the first.
#
# Railway's builder reads this file; `.railwayignore` says the same for
# `railway up`.
/*.mjs
/holdout.json
/train.json
/short-hold.json
/short-train.json
/Epic docs
/Supporting docs
/Claude outputs
